{"id":"3a189f7ee36e22f0","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-church-turing-thesis.md","title":"Church-Turing Thesis","display":"df-church-turing-thesis — Church-Turing Thesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-church-turing-thesis","aliases":["92-df-church-turing-thesis"],"display":"df-church-turing-thesis — Church-Turing Thesis","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件","source_status":"外部递归论背景"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-church-turing-thesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-church-turing-thesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-church-turing-thesis — Church-Turing Thesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论背景"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function on natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffComp}\\)</span> (informal effective-computability predicate on number-theoretic functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total-recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> (definition-target formal statement of the thesis)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{CT}\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffComp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{CT}\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffComp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Church-Turing论题：可计算函数 = 递归函数</li>\n<li>这是论题而非定理（连接形式与直觉）</li>\n<li>支持证据：\n<ol>\n<li>所有已知可计算函数都是递归的</li>\n<li>递归函数都是可计算的</li>\n<li>多种计算模型等价（Turing机、λ演算、递归函数）</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>论题的重要性：为&quot;可计算&quot;提供形式定义</li>\n<li>以“递归可公理化”或“Turing 可判定”作精确定义时，Gödel 不完备性定理本身是形式数学定理，不依赖这一哲学论题；只有把结论转述为关于非形式的“有效方法”时才调用该论题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{CT}\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffComp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1618,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-church-turing-thesis]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b"]}